        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuúqo heewo geeraharuusér serikaáli ngi ilaiwawa/i, asma aleesleemuú amór Mungú dahhaaká i kaahh, nee aleesleemuudá' dáw kuna hara'ayín nee Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe heé heedá' aleesleemuú koóm gu waaqaqaa', hara'ayár Mungú gan waaqaqaá'. Nee kudá' siasiiá' ti sakwasleemár i slayá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma kudá' waawuti'ii'imá', ta múk dae tlaaqiiká tawó alé as tlehhma'aá hho', ala a as tlehhma'aá tlakw. Xáy, kuúng a slá'a heé aleesleemuú koóm kuwa da'ayumitká? Gimáy, kuúng hhooeema na tleehheek, daqaní kuúng uri xirfayees. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma inós a sagadiyusmoó Mungú, as hhooeema ngiwa kuúng i tleehhi. Ala bar tlakweemaá tleehhít, da'ayuút, asma tsataay gu tawó konká, ala a as tawa sagadiyusmoó Mungú oo li/oó bu'uúm dír mukdá' muruú tlákw tlehhiita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, ilaiwa/ame i hariín, as li/aay kilós kuwa da'ayumita'aaká, ala as afoodá' baraá munerhúng wa axwees.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaarí an gár kuungá' tas koódír bu'uunda'. Asma mukdá' aleesleemuú koóm a sagadiyuusér Mungú, qoomár hariímár gadiyér'ín kawa boo/eemisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuúqo heewo tidá' inós wa hariim haniisaak. Heé koódi, koódír i haniisaak, heé ohme, ohmér i haniisaak, kudá' daér wa hariím, da'ayuumitaak, kudá' ilaiwa/amér wa hariím, ilaiwawa/aak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hee muwa iinuús tam gár wake, ala masók gár uwa iinuusi aqo har sla'aari kilós. Asma heé heeqá' slaá', hara'aya gaa boo/eés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hara'ayaarí kah, «Fuqi ma awaar, hee mu gaasaar, gár hee ma fiisaar, gár hee ma ilatleeruusaar,» hara'ayaarí nee hara'ayár hatlá' sleémeero kana haragaás baraá hara'ayaarí wák tidá' kah, «Inslaawmoowók slaeek adoodá' kuúng tir kilók sla'.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heé sla'aarír koóm ga slaiiká hee nguwa gár tlaákw i tleehhi. Gawaá adoorihe sla'aari a boo/eemisuú hara'aya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorí tleehhaak ar ilakaahara, asma kuungá' qoomaarí ta koomaan a xuá'. Slám a xuá' kuungá' gár tunduwa hariím, hamí an tleerá' baraá gu'uteero. Asma ba/ama hamí naa diréní naká/, ta ak qoomaadá' atén haratlintaao kawa iimu/uumani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xweera naa harafaakiyé', tlaatla/aangw naa haranakaá/. Gawaá adoorihe tlehhmi'iidá' ki mawaán, nee xosluudaá slaqwara awa gwa/aateema ki oohaán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atén masók an hootaán ar ilaiwa/ame ar adoodá' hotaá tlatla/aangw kiwa hariím. Ala mawa hootaán ar hheehha nee xufta, laqaá ar tsaatu'uuma nee ar slafíngw slasla/arén. Nee slám mawa hootaán ar gila nee da/i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kuungá' Aako Yesu Kristo na oohaak tawa baqamorhúng, nee slám ma kumiitara' ilatleerír slaqoohúng kawa tleemisa'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
